    "answer": "sake/Japanese-rice-wine",
    "mnemonic": "You know that <ja>日本</ja> is \"Japan\" so when you add <kanji>alcohol</kanji> onto the end of that you have <vocabulary>Japanese Style Alcohol</vocabulary> (what's the big Japanese style alcohol that everyone knows? That's <vocabulary>sake</vocabulary>).",
